# What not to upload when deploying.
#
# Vercel sends the working directory, not the git tree, so anything sitting
# in here goes with it - including files that were never committed.
#
# Deliberately short. Excluding something the build turns out to need fails
# the deploy for no gain, so this only lists what is certainly not wanted.

# Secrets. The deployed site reads its settings from the project's
# environment variables, never from a file, so these must not travel.
.env*

# The local SQLite database. Production uses Supabase.
.data/

# Pages saved out of a browser ("Save page as" leaves a .html and a _files
# folder beside it) while reading the Supabase dashboard.
*.html
*_files/
